{"abstract":[{"text":"A work as a MIDI player plays it: every part’s channel messages, each at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its time in the work, in the order they are sent.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WorkPerformance","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/UsingIvorExtern"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The times are kept exactly as the work has them — never as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"floating-point seconds — so that events at the same time are ordered as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Event","isActive":true},{"text":" says, never by rounding. Each part has a channel of its own,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"skipping channel 10, which General MIDI keeps for percussion, until there","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are more parts than channels, when they share.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each of a part’s instruments sounds as the realization assigns it — the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"part’s own assignment, else the realization’s default — and plays on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"assignment’s channel, if it names one, or a percussion patch on channel","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"10, or else on the part’s own channel. An instrument the realization","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t assign sounds as ","type":"text"},{"code":"IvorMIDI\/MIDIPatch\/init(instrument:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Every channel a part uses gets its first patch at the start, so an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instrument change that moves to another channel sends no program change","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"partway through; one that stays on the channel sends one, after a bank","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"select if the patch has a bank, or if the channel’s previous patch had","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one, which is then reset to bank 0 (see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"IvorMIDI\/MIDIPatch\/selectionMessages(on:after:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each note sounds at the velocity of the part’s dynamic level at its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attack, so a crescendo rises note by note — or, where an importer kept","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the note’s exact velocity (its ","type":"text"},{"code":"attackVelocity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" extra), at that.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pan and expression are per channel, so each channel takes those of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first part that plays on it, and a later part that shares the channel","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sends none. A part sends its pan on every channel it owns at the start,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and again at a pan-map entry or one of its attacks where the pan has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"changed, and throughout a glide while a note sounds. An entry’s exact","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"14-bit pan, where an importer kept one, is sent as it is.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A part also sends expression (CC 11) on every channel it owns except","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"percussion, starting at the start, so that a crescendo or diminuendo","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reaches a note already sounding, wherever a held note would otherwise","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"drift audibly from the written level. The expression is relative to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"velocity: a note attacking during one has a higher velocity, so it still","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sounds at the written level. Where an importer kept a file’s exact","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"expression (the ","type":"text"},{"code":"expressionValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" extra of a dynamic-map entry), that is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sent as it is instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pedals follow pan’s rule: a part sends its pedals on every channel it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"owns, percussion included, and a later part sharing a channel sends none,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so a shared channel’s pedals hold every part’s notes on it. Each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pedal-table entry is sent exactly as stored, in table order, never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sampled, so a re-pedal (an Up then a Down at one time) lets the pedal up","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and puts it down again. Muting mutes notes only, so a muted part’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pedals are still sent. Portamento (CC 65) isn’t sent yet: a future","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gliding-notes feature will send it, and decide who owns it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every note says which part it belongs to, so that a mixer can mute one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"part of several sharing a channel. The performance itself sends no channel","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"volume (CC 7), which it leaves to the mixer.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For now a note that glides plays its start key only. Only a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keyboard-pitch, wall-time work can be made into a performance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Event"],"generated":true},{"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/init(work:realization:)"],"generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/duration","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/events","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/ownedChannelSets","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/partChannelSets","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/partChannels"],"generated":true},{"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/channelOutputs(forPartOutputs:)"],"generated":true},{"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true}],"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance"]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:10IvorExtern15WorkPerformanceV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WorkPerformance","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"WorkPerformance","modules":[{"name":"IvorExtern"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WorkPerformance"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://IvorExtern/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/init(work:realization:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/init(work:realization:)","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/init(work:realization:)","kind":"symbol","title":"init(work:realization:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"?(","kind":"text"},{"text":"work","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel4WorkV","text":"Work","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"realization","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel11RealizationV","text":"Realization","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?)","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Creates a ","type":"text"},{"code":"WorkPerformance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instance for the provided work, as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provided realization assigns its sounds, or ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if the work isn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in keyboard pitch and wall time.","type":"text"}]},"doc://IvorExtern/SQ":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/SQ","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Equatable"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/duration":{"abstract":[{"text":"The time of the last event, or zero for a work with no events.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"duration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8WallTimeV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WallTime"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/duration","title":"duration","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/duration"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/Event":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Event","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Event","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One channel message at its time in a work, exactly as the work has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it."}],"title":"WorkPerformance.Event","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/event"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/partChannelSets":{"role":"symbol","title":"partChannelSets","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/partChannelSets","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/partchannelsets","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Every channel each part plays on, in the work’s order: the one each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of its instruments sounds on, which is the part’s own unless an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"assignment moves the instrument.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"partChannelSets"},{"kind":"text","text":": [["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8IvorMIDI11MIDIChannelV","text":"MIDIChannel"},{"kind":"text","text":"]]"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/channelOutputs(forPartOutputs:)":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/channelOutputs(forPartOutputs:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns which output each channel plays through, given each part’s."}],"title":"channelOutputs(forPartOutputs:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"channelOutputs","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Output","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"forPartOutputs","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Output","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorExtern15WorkPerformanceV14channelOutputs07forPartF0SayxSgGSayxG_tlF6OutputL_xmfp"},{"text":"]) -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Output","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorExtern15WorkPerformanceV14channelOutputs07forPartF0SayxSgGSayxG_tlF6OutputL_xmfp"},{"text":"?]","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/channeloutputs(forpartoutputs:)"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/Equatable-Implementations":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Equatable-Implementations","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/equatable-implementations","kind":"article","title":"Equatable Implementations","role":"collectionGroup","type":"topic","abstract":[]},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/ownedChannelSets":{"role":"symbol","title":"ownedChannelSets","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/ownedChannelSets","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/ownedchannelsets","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The channels each part owns, in the work’s order: those of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/partChannelSets"},{"type":"text","text":" that no earlier part plays on."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ownedChannelSets"},{"kind":"text","text":": [["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8IvorMIDI11MIDIChannelV","text":"MIDIChannel"},{"kind":"text","text":"]]"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://IvorExtern/s8CopyableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s8CopyableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Copyable"},"doc://IvorExtern/s9EscapableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s9EscapableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Escapable"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/events":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/events","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/events","kind":"symbol","title":"events","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"events","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorExtern15WorkPerformanceV5EventV","text":"Event","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The events, in the order they are sent.","type":"text"}]},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/partChannels":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/partChannels","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/partchannels","kind":"symbol","title":"partChannels","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"partChannels","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8IvorMIDI11MIDIChannelV","text":"MIDIChannel","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The channel each part plays on unless an assignment says otherwise,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the work’s order.","type":"text"}]},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WorkPerformance","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A work as a MIDI player plays it: every part’s channel messages, each at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its time in the work, in the order they are sent."}],"title":"WorkPerformance","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WorkPerformance","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern":{"title":"IvorExtern","abstract":[{"text":"An import and export framework for external music notation formats.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern","role":"collection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/UsingIvorExtern":{"title":"Using IvorExtern","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Read works from external music notation files, write them back out, and turn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them into MIDI for playback."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/usingivorextern","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/UsingIvorExtern","role":"article","kind":"article"},"doc://IvorExtern/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Sw